{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 19, :comments ["<b>And to set you high.</b> For understanding and instruction, as it says: וְאַתֶּם תִּהְיוּ לִי מַמְלֶכֶת כֹּהֲנִים (Exodus 19:6)." "<b>For praise and for name and for glory.</b> To El, blessed be He, as it says (Isaiah 49:3): יִשְׂרָאֵל אֲשֶׁר בְּךָ אֶתְפָּאָר." "<b>And to make you a holy people.</b> Eternal, for the life of the world to come." "<b>As He spoke.</b> In His saying: וְאַתֶּם תִּהְיוּ לִי מַמְלֶכֶת כֹּהֲנִים וְגוֹי קָדוֹשׁ (Exodus 19:6)."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 26, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:22:20.124600975Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}